        "created_at": "2013-10-08T22:55:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm assuming that the current look of the GSF website is unintended.&nbsp; The art's gone, the font is more professional-looking, the space background is gone.&nbsp; Maybe the change was unintentional?</p><p>Also, the site still says the Kickstarter is still live, which is no longer true in this timestream.</p>",
