        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-10-09T17:39:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Confirmed, the GSF site is back to its old, spacey self.&nbsp; It still says the GSF Kickstarter is live, which I guess is just an artifact of the time dialation caused by the FTL drives in the game itself.&nbsp; The closer to the speed of light you go, the slower time becomes, hence a perpetual Kickstarter. It's genius, really. ;)</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
